    },
    {
      "description": "candidate_materials.md is updated with at least three new candidate compounds (e.g., carbonaceous sulfur hydride, lanthanum hydride, nickelate) and their predicted critical temperatures.",
      "expectedFiles": ["candidate_materials.md"]
