    "severity": "high",
    "suggestion": "Implement generate_candidates.py to read data/superconductor_database.json, apply filtering criteria (e.g., predicted Tc > 300 K, pressure < 300 GPa), and output a list of candidate materials. Implement query_database.py to allow querying by composition, Tc range, or pressure. Add corresponding unit tests."
